{
  "about": [
    "Fleet status cases shared by the backend and the OLIWA app, so the two",
    "count a fleet the same way. The master copy is",
    "navas-core-apis/tests/fixtures/fleet_status_cases.json; the app keeps an",
    "identical copy at oliwa-mobile/test/fixtures/fleet_status_cases.json.",
    "",
    "Run by: navas-core-apis/tests/test_fleet_status_shared.py",
    "        oliwa-mobile/test/fleet_status_shared_test.dart",
    "Each also compares its copy with the other repository's, when that is",
    "checked out beside it. Change a rule: change this file, copy it across,",
    "and make both suites pass.",
    "",
    "A unit is a live-feed frame (the x-location / Redis snapshot fields) and",
    "how long ago it reported. frame null with never true: no position and no",
    "heartbeat, ever. unread true: the lookup failed. Heartbeat-only units",
    "(no frame, but a heartbeat) are backend-only and tested there."
  ],
  "now": "2026-10-26T13:00:00",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "fresh reports are taken as they are",
      "units": [
        {"id": "moving", "minutes_ago": 1, "frame": {"motion_state": "Moving", "speed_log": 40, "ignition_state": "ON", "data_latitude": 0.3376, "data_longitude": 32.7004, "data_connected_satelites": 15}, "expect": "moving"},
        {"id": "idling (feed spelling)", "minutes_ago": 2, "frame": {"motion_state": "Idiling", "speed_log": 0, "ignition_state": "ON", "data_latitude": 0.4484, "data_longitude": 30.1982, "data_connected_satelites": 12}, "expect": "idling"},
